om is  connected to the demons and while I was  hoping that Yami and the black bulls  would finally give them the issue and  the obnoxious Nobles of what's coming to  them and I am kind of disappointed that  everything was ultimately resolved so  peacefully thanks to Julius we have to  remember that if this conflict really  escalated into a civil war it would not  have been good for anyone whenever there  is a war civil or otherwise the people  who suffer the most are the poorest and  least powerful members of society  the rich and powerful have the means to  get out of harm's way they have places  to go and they can use their money and  influence to protect themselves the  common everyday people who don't have  money or power are always the ones who  suffer the most because they are the  ones who always find themselves on the  front lines so in the end as much as I  wanted to see the nobles get their just  desserts this is the best decision for  everyone and this mission the Julius  came up with and how he went about it  proves that despite being a kid Julius  is still extremely intelligent and a  master strategist I am very much looking  forward to seeing where the story will  go from here  I love the magical world of black horror  and I'm happy that more world building  is coming our way let me know what you  guys think Are you disappointed that  Dame natio didn't get rekt by Yami or do  you think that this was for the best  also where exactly do you think that the  black balls will go after leaving the  clover Kingdom let me know down below if  you enjoyed the black clover content on  this channel and you want to see more  please leave a like to let me know and  if you happen to be new to anime uproar  don't forget to subscribe and hit that  notification bell you can also follow me  on twitter and instagram at anime uproar  for all the latest black clover news and  updates i want to give a big thank you  to all of our  anime opera patrons for supporting our  wor